# shell_demo, scripted: move the sprite, click (sound), type, resize, toggle borderless twice, F12 capture, screenshot, quit.
# Ticks are shell ticks; a scripted run uses a fixed 1/60 s step, so one tick is one Update.
frame 5 mouse 200 120
frame 10 key W down
frame 10 key D down
frame 40 key W up
frame 60 key D up
frame 70 mouse 400 300
frame 75 click left
frame 80 text hello world
frame 90 resize 1024 600
frame 110 key F11 press
frame 140 key F11 press
frame 170 mouse 700 380
frame 170 key S down
frame 170 key Space down
frame 175 text !
frame 180 key F12 press
frame 200 shot
frame 240 quit
